lass=\"bb_paragraph\" > I see two possible outcomes for this endeavor, leading to two different endings. A second scenario can be unlocked by getting to one of them, allowing the other to be reached through a rerun of the experiment under harder conditions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443900/extras/2f697d655e62dd21f6222297f65577fb.avif?t=1767536023\" width=616 height=290 /></span></p>","developers":["Flat Voxel"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443900/407692a5a297684fb476f895a019bd1fdae2ba9c/header.jpg?t=1767536023","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2443900/1596635965/aa37eb6e30c1f61fc71e420524bf39e66c2d9fdf/1767534758/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767536023","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2443900/1596635965/aa37eb6e30c1f61fc71e420524bf39e66c2d9fdf/1767534758/dash_h264.mpd?t=1767536023","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2443900/1596635965/aa37eb6e30c1f61fc71e420524bf39e66c2d9fdf/1767534758/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1767536023","id":256950367,"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256950367/39f7550289f0b347aeb9479be4e65c0ddfcc8224/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1767536023"}],"name":"A Simple Expurriment","package_groups":[],